## BEFORE EVERY git commit OR git push COMMAND:

Read the current user message.
Does it contain: коммить, коммит, commit, пуш, пушь, push, закоммить, запушь?
NO → STOP. Do not run the command. Do not proceed.
YES → Proceed.

## NEVER PUSH TO MAIN. EVER.

PUSH ONLY TO A FEATURE BRANCH. NEVER TO main.
NEVER run: git push origin main
NEVER run: git push (when on main branch)
ALWAYS push to a named branch: git push origin <branch-name>

If the user says "пуш" or "push" — push to the FEATURE BRANCH only.
After pushing the branch, tell the user the PR link. Do NOT push to main.

